"The preferred output aggregation temporality. Options include DELTA, "
"LOWMEMORY, and CUMULATIVE.\n"
"\n"
"If CUMULATIVE, all instruments will have cumulative temporality. If DELTA, "
"counter (sync and async) and histograms will be delta, up down counters "
