"`OtlpExporterRuntimeConfig++#++DEFAULT_HTTP_BASE_URI`.\n"
"\n"
"There is a generic property, that will apply to all signals and a signal "
"specific one, following the pattern: `quarkus.otel.exporter.otlp..endpoint` "
"where  is one of the supported signal types, like `traces` or `metrics`.\n"
